[0.311128, "o", "\u001b[1mvibe-rescue fix\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m/tmp/vibe-fix-klsnwtrm\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mleaked-secrets\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx:5\u001b[22m\r\n     Hardcoded service role jwt in client file src/main.tsx.\r\n\u001b[2m     Move it to SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in a gitignored .env file and rotate it.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2m.env\u001b[22m\r\n     .env is not gitignored and can be committed with secrets.\r\n\u001b[2m     Add it to .gitignore. If git already tracks it, run git rm --cached .env and rotate the keys.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated src/main.tsx\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  created src/vibe-rescue/server-only-env.ts\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .gitignore\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .env\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  created .env.example\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: Rotate SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY. It was exposed in src/main.tsx.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: .env is now gitignored. If git still tracks it, run: git rm --cached .env\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mimport-paths\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx\u001b[22m\r\n     src/main.tsx imports date-fns, which is not in package.json.\r\n\u001b[2m     date-fns will be added with version *. Run npm install afterwards.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx\u001b[22m\r\n     src/main.tsx imports ./components/button, but the path on disk is ./components/Button.\r\n\u001b[2m     The specifier will be rewritten to the casing that exists on disk.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated src/main.tsx\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated package.json\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: Added date-fns@* to package.json. Run npm install to fetch it.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mhardcoded-localhost\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/main.tsx:7\u001b[22m\r\n     Hardcoded http://localhost:3000 in src/main.tsx.\r\n\u001b[2m     Use import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL. VITE_API_BASE_URL will be added to .env.example.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated src/main.tsx\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .env.example\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .env\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: Localhost origins were copied into .env as the local default. Change them per environment.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mspa-rewrites\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mvercel.json\u001b[22m\r\n     vercel.json has no SPA rewrite to /index.html.\r\n\u001b[2m     A rewrite to /index.html will be added. Nothing is deployed.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mnetlify.toml\u001b[22m\r\n     Netlify redirect from /* to /index.html (200) is missing.\r\n\u001b[2m     A rewrite to /index.html will be added. Nothing is deployed.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mpublic/_redirects\u001b[22m\r\n     Static host _redirects rule /* /index.html 200 is missing.\r\n\u001b[2m     A rewrite to /index.html will be added. Nothing is deployed.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated vercel.json\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  created netlify.toml\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  created public/_redirects\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: Host rewrites send unknown paths to index.html with status 200. API routes are left alone when an api/ directory exists.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1msupabase-rls\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msupabase/migrations/20240101000000_init.sql\u001b[22m\r\n     Table public.notes is created without ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY.\r\n\u001b[2m     A new migration will enable RLS and add a deny-all policy for anon and authenticated. No database is contacted.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  created supabase/migrations/20261111204433_vibe_rescue_enable_rls.sql\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: Review the new migration before you apply it. vibe-rescue does not connect to a database.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: The deny-all policy blocks anon and authenticated until you replace it with a real policy. The service role bypasses RLS.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mwebhook-signature\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mserver/stripe-webhook.ts\u001b[22m\r\n     server/stripe-webhook.ts handles a Stripe webhook without constructEvent.\r\n\u001b[2m     A signature check will be inserted. Set STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET and send Stripe the raw body.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated server/stripe-webhook.ts\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .env.example\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: server/stripe-webhook.ts: Verify the Stripe signature with constructEvent before trusting the event.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mmissing-env\u001b[22m  \u001b"]
[0.311776, "o", "[32mfixed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mserver/stripe-webhook.ts:4\u001b[22m\r\n     STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET is referenced in server/stripe-webhook.ts but missing from .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2mserver/stripe-webhook.ts:18\u001b[22m\r\n     STRIPE_SECRET_KEY is referenced in server/stripe-webhook.ts but missing from .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/lib/config.ts:1\u001b[22m\r\n     API_TOKEN is referenced in src/lib/config.ts but missing from .env.example and .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[39m  \u001b[2msrc/lib/config.ts:2\u001b[22m\r\n     VITE_SUPABASE_URL is referenced in src/lib/config.ts but missing from .env.example and .env.\r\n\u001b[2m     An .env.example entry and .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs will be generated. Fill in the real value locally.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .env.example\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated .env\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  created .vibe-rescue/check-env.mjs\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  updated package.json\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: Empty values were added. The startup check exits until those variables are set.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[33m  note: npm run dev runs the check first via predev when a dev script exists.\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m  Verification passed.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m7 rules changed files · 0 rolled back · 12 files\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2mBackups: .vibe-rescue/backups/20261111T204433Z (gitignored, may contain secrets).\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mvibe-rescue-kit by deepelynx\u001b[22m\r\n"]
